            "review_title": "Review at Sui Cao 162 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Rob H\n15 contributions\n0\nExploring Sui Cao Street\nJan 2024 • Friends\nWe searched down Ha Ton Quyen street and Sui Cao 162 in District 11 after seeing a food documentary on the plane about the famous Sui Cao Street! It was a bit further from the more touristy District 1&2 but very easy to reach on a Grab bike for a few dollars. The street itself is worth a walk seeing all the different Sui Cao vendors but we decided on Sui Cao 162 and we’re not disappointed. Good simple and tasty street food style at a reasonable price. My friend and I both picked a Sui Cao in a noodle soup and went back for seconds of some more Sui Cao without broth. Definitely worth a try in Ho Chi Minh City!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 23, 2024",
