            "review_text": "Tony Le\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam753 contributions\n0\nA good address for Chinese Wonton\nOct 2020\nLocated on Ha Ton Quyen Street, District 11 (a famous street for Chinese wontons), Woton 162 is the choice of most diners who know this dish.\nWonton 162 has dried wonton, fried wonton, and mixed noodles. The quality is quite good.\nThe restaurant is very crowded, so avoid rush hours because of the possibility of traffic jams and no seats.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 6, 2020",
